  "reference": "1 Mambo Ya Nyakati 9",
  "verseCount": 44,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo, watu wote wa Israeli waliandikishwa katika nasaba, na orodha hiyo imeandikwa katika Kitabu cha Wafalme wa Israeli. Watu wa Yuda walikuwa wamechukuliwa mateka hadi Babuloni kwa sababu ya kutokuwa waaminifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wa kwanza kuyarudia makazi yao katika miji yao walikuwa raia wa kawaida, makuhani, Walawi na watumishi wa hekaluni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baadhi ya watu wa makabila ya Yuda, Benyamini, Efraimu na Manase walikwenda kuishi mjini Yerusalemu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uthai mwana wa Amihudi, mwana wa Omri, mwana wa Imri, mwana wa Bani, wa wana wa Peresi, mwana wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wazawa wa Shilo, Asaya mzaliwa wa kwanza, kiongozi na wanawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wazawa wa Zera, Yeueli, na ndugu zao; watu 690. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wa wazawa wa Benyamini: Salu mwana wa Meshulamu, mwana wa Hodavia, mwana wa Hasenua; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Ibneya mwana wa Yerohamu, Ela, mwana wa Uzi, mwana wa Mikri; na Meshulamu, mwana wa Shefatia, mwana wa Reueli, mwana wa Ibniya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ndugu zao, sawasawa na vizazi vyao; watu956. Watu hao wote ndio waliokuwa wakuu wa koo za baba zao, kwa kadiri ya koo za baba zao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makuhani wafuatao waliishi Yerusalemu: Yedaya, Yehoyaribu na Yakini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Azaria mwana wa Hilkia, mwana wa Meshulamu, mwana wa Sadoki, mwana wa Merayothi, mwana wa Ahitubu, mkuu wa nyumba ya Mungu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Adaya, mwana wa Yerohamu, mwana wa Pashuri, mwana wa Malkiya; na Maasai, mwana wa Adieli, mwana wa Yazera, mwana wa Meshulamu, mwana wa Meshilemithi, mwana wa Imeri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakuu wa koo za baba zao; pamoja na ndugu zao; jumla watu 1,760. Walikuwa wakuu wenye uwezo mkubwa katika huduma yote ya nyumba ya Mungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walawi wafuatao waliishi Yerusalemu: Shemaya, mwana wa Hashubu, mwana wa Azrikamu, mwana wa Hashabia, wa wana wa Merari; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Bakbakari, na Hereshi, na Galali, Matania, mwana wa Mika, mwana wa Zikri, mwana wa Asafu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Obadia, mwana wa Shemaya, mwana wa Galali, mwana wa Yeduthuni; na Berekia, mwana wa Asa, mwana wa Elkana; waliokuwa wakiishi katika vijiji vya Wanetofathi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walinzi wa hekalu wafuatao pia waliishi katika Yerusalemu: Shalumu, Akubu, Talmoni na Ahimani na ndugu zao. Shalumu alikuwa mkuu wao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadi kufikia wakati huo, walinzi kutoka katika koo zao ndio waliolinda Lango la mfalme",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lango la mfalme:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lango la mashariki alilopitia mfalme.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " la upande wa mashariki. Hapo awali, walikuwa walinzi wa maingilio ya makambi ya Walawi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shalumu, mwana wa Kore, mwana wa Ebiasafu, pamoja na ndugu zake wa ukoo wa Kora, walikuwa na wajibu wa kuyatunza maingilio ya hema la mkutano, kama vile walivyokuwa babu zake wakati wa ulinzi wa kambi ya Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Finehasi, mwana wa Eleazari, alikuwa msimamizi wao, hapo awali, naye Mwenyezi-Mungu alikuwa pamoja naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zekaria mwana wa Meshelemia, pia alikuwa mlinzi wa maingilio ya hema la mkutano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jumla, watu 212 walichaguliwa kuwa walinzi wa maingilio ya hekalu. Waliandikishwa kulingana na vijiji walimoishi. Mfalme Daudi na Samueli mwonaji ndio waliowathibitisha katika wadhifa huu muhimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, watu hao na wazawa wao, waliendelea kuyalinda malango ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kila upande, yaani mashariki, magharibi, kaskazini na kusini, palikuwa na lango lililokuwa na walinzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walinzi hawa walisaidiwa na ndugu zao waliokuwa wakiishi vijijini, ambao walilazimika kushika zamu ya ulinzi kwa muda wa siku saba, mara kwa mara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwa maana wale walinzi wakuu wanne, ambao walikuwa Walawi, walikuwa na wajibu wa kusimamia vyumba na hazina ya nyumba ya Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wao waliishi karibu na nyumba ya Mungu kwa sababu ilikuwa ni wajibu wao kuyalinda na kuyafungua malango yake kila siku asubuhi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baadhi ya Walawi walisimamia vyombo vilivyotumika wakati wa ibada. Walihitajika kuvihesabu wakati vilipotolewa na wakati viliporudishwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wengine walichaguliwa kuvisimamia vifaa vya hekalu, na vyombo vyote vitakatifu, na unga safi, divai, mafuta ya zeituni, ubani na manukato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini kazi ya kutayarisha manukato ilifanywa na makuhani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metithia, mmoja wa Walawi aliyekuwa mzaliwa wa kwanza wa Shalumu, wa ukoo wa Kora, alisimamia utengenezaji wa tambiko ya mikate myembamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ndugu zao wengine wa ukoo wa Kohathi walikuwa na wajibu wa kutayarisha mikate ya wonyesho kwa ajili ya hekalu kila Sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jamaa nyingine za Walawi zilisimamia huduma ya nyimbo hekaluni. Waliishi katika baadhi ya majengo ya nyumba ya Mungu na hawakuhitajika kufanya kazi nyingine yoyote kwa maana walikuwa kazini usiku na mchana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wote hawa waliotajwa walikuwa viongozi wa kabila la Walawi, kulingana na koo zao. Wao ndio viongozi walioishi Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeieli alikuwa mwanzilishi wa mji wa Gibeoni ambamo aliishi yeye pamoja na mkewe, jina lake Maaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzaliwa wake wa kwanza alikuwa Abdoni, naye alifuatiwa na Zuri, Kishi, Baali, Neri, Nadabu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedori, Ahio, Zekaria na Miklothi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miklothi alimzaa Shimeamu. Wazawa wao waliishi Yerusalemu karibu na jamaa nyingine za koo zao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neri alimzaa Kishi, naye Kishi akamzaa Shauli. Shauli alikuwa na wana wanne: Yonathani, Malki-shua, Abinadabu na Eshbaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonathani alimzaa Merib-baali, Merib-baali akamzaa Mika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mika alikuwa na wana wanne: Pithoni, Meleki, Tarea na Ahazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:41",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ahazi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kiebrania hakina Ahazi (taz 8:35).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazi alimzaa Yara, Yara akawazaa Alemethi, Azmawethi na Zimri, naye Zimri akamzaa Mosa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosa akamzaa Binea, Binea akamzaa Refaya, Refaya akamzaa Eleasa, naye Eleasa akamzaa Aseli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
